# Feature Requirements

## Community Feed (default landing)

Infinite scroll + skeleton loading; pagination fallback. Real-time updates via Socket.IO — feed should feel alive.

**Report card (top):** "What's happening in your community?" — Upload Photo, Capture Camera, Current Location, Select Category, CTA "Report Civic Issue". No citizen registration/login.

**Issue posts:** avatar, report text, location, timestamp, image, title, description, AI summary, category, severity, priority, assigned department, AI confidence, support count, comments, share, bookmark, status timeline, before/after resolution.

## Support System

"Support Issue" (not likes). Animated button, duplicate prevention, anonymous browser tracking, community impact calculation.

## Comments

Threaded replies, newest/popular sorting, useful community discussion.

## AI Section

**Citizen UI:** "Analyzed by CivicConnect AI" — classification, confidence, severity, priority, recommended department, nearby similar reports.

**Admin UI:** full diagnostics, duplicate detection, fake report flags.

## Status Timeline

Reported → AI Verified → Assigned → In Progress → Resolved. Current stage highlighted, animated transitions.

## Resolution Story

Before/after images, department, engineer, resolution notes, date, time taken.

## Right Sidebar

Trending issues, critical issues, nearby issues, recent resolutions, community statistics, AI insights.

## Map

Interactive Google Maps/Leaflet — issue pins, cluster markers, filters, nearby search, navigation.

## Filters & Search

Category, priority, status, department, location, date; sort by most supported, newest, nearest, trending. Instant debounced search with keyword highlighting.

## Admin Dashboard

JWT auth, analytics, issue queue, AI review, department assignment, status updates, resolution upload, performance dashboard.

## Real-Time (Socket.IO)

Status updates, support counts, comments, notifications, live admin changes.
